        {
          "text": "Nobanoozoocili mukwaamba kuti, Kwatontola, kwaliiba, elyo muciindi eco nciconya lunyonyooko luzoofwambaana kubasikila mbuli insungo mbozisikila uumisi, nkabela tabakooyooloboka pe. ",
